@page "/progress"

<PageTitle>Progress | Python Study Companion</PageTitle>

<section class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">SMALL WINS ADD UP.</p>
    <h1>Your progress</h1>
    <p>A clearer picture of how far you've come.</p>
</section>

<section class="empty-state" aria-labelledby="progress-heading">
    <span class="action-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
    <span class="pill">MILESTONE 4</span>
    <h2 id="progress-heading">A fresh start.</h2>
    <p>Cards studied, correct and incorrect answers, quiz performance, topic proficiency, daily activity, and streaks will appear here.</p>
    <p>Local progress storage and JSON backup import and export are not connected yet. No study activity is currently recorded.</p>
    <a class="button" href="">Back to dashboard</a>
</section>
